{% if fills %}Two players each move a figure on their own {{ grid_size }}x{{ grid_size }} grid of squares, each square holding an item (a shape with a colour and a fill), and score when both finish on the same item. Each sees the other's moves{% if not partner_colours_visible %} but not the other's squares{% endif %}. Each player's instructions list the colours, the shapes and the fills in orders drawn for that player alone. There is no channel; moves are the only thing that passes between them.{% elif shapes %}Two players each move a figure on their own {{ grid_size }}x{{ grid_size }} grid of squares, each square holding a coloured shape, and score when both finish on the same shape in the same colour. Each sees the other's moves{% if not partner_colours_visible %} but not the other's squares{% endif %}. Each player's instructions list the colours and the shapes in orders drawn for that player alone. There is no channel; moves are the only thing that passes between them.{% else %}Two players each move a figure on their own {{ grid_size }}x{{ grid_size }} grid of coloured squares and score when both finish on the same colour. Each sees the other's moves{% if not partner_colours_visible %} but not the other's colours{% endif %}. Each player's instructions list the colours in an order drawn for that player alone. There is no channel; moves are the only thing that passes between them.{% endif %}
